    oe:answerText "Dasatinib is an effective treatment for Philadelphia chromosome-positive (Ph+) acute leukemia, but some patients develop resistance. Combination treatment with dasatinib and asciminib, an allosteric inhibitor of BCR::ABL1, may deepen responses and prevent the emergence of dasatinib-resistant clones."^^xsd:string ;
